y want to work in","row_1_label":"Temu \/ marketplace boxes:","row_1_text":"no way to inspect it first, inconsistent quality between listings, and no one to call if a drawer fails.","row_2_label":"Snap-on:","row_2_text":"the gold standard, but a comparable cabinet runs into the thousands — built for a pro's truck route, not a weekend budget.","highlight_label":"With TOOSA","highlight_text":"they get welded steel storage they can see and touch at the Richmond showroom, pay monthly with RBC, and grow the setup over time with foam, lighting and engraving."}},"customer_type_bibpw7":{"type":"customer_type","settings":{"title":"Small Businesses & Trade Shops","subtitle":"Outfitting one to three bays that run every day","row_1_label":"Temu \/ marketplace boxes:","row_1_text":"not built for daily commercial use — a failed drawer or caster becomes shop downtime, with no warranty to fall back on.","row_2_label":"Snap-on:","row_2_text":"excellent for daily use, but outfitting several bays at premium pricing ties up capital a small shop needs elsewhere.","highlight_label":"With TOOSA","highlight_text":"they get commercial-duty storage and air at a fraction of premium pricing, RBC financing that protects cash flow, and Canadian parts if something needs replacing."}},"customer_type_VkGXVh":{"type":"customer_type","settings":{"title":"Bigger Businesses & Production","subtitle":"Standardizing storage and air across a whole facility","row_1_label":"Temu \/ marketplace boxes:","row_1_text":"no consistency unit-to-unit, no account support, and no compliance paperwork — not a serious option at scale.","row_2_label":"Snap-on:","row_2_text":"capable at scale, but standardizing a whole facility at premium pricing and truck-route lead times is a major capital commitment.","highlight_label":"With TOOSA","highlight_text":"they get one Canadian supplier for storage and industrial air (including the 20 HP rotary-screw compressor), consistent equipment across every bay, and financing to spread the cost."}}},"block_order":["customer_type_JwjfTJ","customer_type_bibpw7","customer_type_VkGXVh"],"name":"TOOSA Customer Picks","settings":{"eyebrow":"EVERY KIND OF WORKSHOP","heading":"Why each type of customer picks TOOSA","description":"Three very different buyers, three different reasons and the same two alternatives each of them is really weighing us against."}},"toosa_quality_positioning_kQC7Hx":{"type":"toosa-quality-positioning","name":"TOOSA Positioning","settings":{"eyebrow":"WHERE TOOSA SITS","heading":"High quality expectations, without the Snap-on invoice","description":"<p>Positioned the way Canadian workshops actually shop: not the unverified marketplace box, not the premium truck brand — the durable, supported middle that most garages and shops are really looking for.<\/p>","footnote":"Illustrative positioning, not to scale — based on published Snap-on features, forum-reported Temu quality issues, and TOOSA's own construction (see sources in the appendix).","chart_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Quality_vs_Price_Brand_Positioning.png","max_width":1080,"content_width":560,"column_gap":72,"desktop_top_padding":42,"desktop_bottom_padding":24,"image_radius":0,"background_color":"#f3f4f5","heading_color":"#000000","text_color":"#000000","accent_color":"#ff6f3c","chart_background":"#ffffff","chart_border":"#dce0e3"}},"tool_side_by_side_comparison_KNrXh9":{"type":"Tool-side-by-side-comparison","blocks":{"comparison_item_AjihVb":{"type":"comparison_item","settings":{"label":"Price (CAD)","toosa":"From $1,599","snap":"$7,000–$12,000 +1","temu":"~$550–$950 2"}},"comparison_item_dMdLzY":{"type":"comparison_item","settings":{"label":"Price (CAD)","toosa":"From $1,599","snap":"$7,000–$12,000 +1","temu":"~$550–$950 2"}},"comparison_item_HHiFr4":{"type":"comparison_item","settings":{"label":"Price (CAD)","toosa":"From $1,599","snap":"$7,000–$12,000 +1","temu":"~$550–$950 2"}},"comparison_item_L6hmHm":{"type":"comparison_item","settings":{"label":"Price (CAD)","to